---
title: "generateDepositSignature (Legion: API Integration Flow)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_receive: GET /v1/integration/rounds/id/signature
    q_receive --> q_auth: validate JWT token
    q_auth --> q_unauthorized: token invalid
    q_unauthorized --> [*]: return 401 unauthorized
    q_auth --> q_lookup: token valid
    q_lookup --> q_not_found: round does not exist
    q_not_found --> [*]: return 404 not found
    q_lookup --> q_check_app: round exists
    q_check_app --> q_no_app: user has no application for round
    q_no_app --> [*]: return error no application
    q_check_app --> q_generate: application exists
    q_generate --> q_sign: create cryptographic signature for deposit
    q_sign --> [*]: return deposit signature

    note right of q_generate
        INV-001: signature must be bound to specific user and round
        INV-002: signature must be valid for smart contract deposit call
        INV-003: only users with submitted applications may obtain signatures
    end note
